e limitations of automated verification occurs in specialized mathematical and scientific codebases. During the generation of a fluid dynamics simulation using the D2Q9 Lattice Boltzmann Method (LBM) in C++, an AI agent produced the following syntax-valid array constants:"), "\n", React.createElement(_components.pre, null, React.createElement(_components.code, {
